This product includes MIL-STD-2525D entity and modifier names derived from
the Joint Military Symbology Markup Language (JMSML)
https://github.com/Esri/joint-military-symbology-xml
(commit 094e7647f0bdd001e42fd2a73ba802c995af20aa), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see data/JMSML-LICENSE.txt). The names were converted to
TypeScript identifiers by scripts/generate-names.mjs; the changed form is
src/names-2525d.generated.ts (labels and codes are unchanged).

It also includes MIL-STD-2525C to MIL-STD-2525D symbol mappings derived from
the same JMSML commit's legacy symbol tables. The ID references were resolved
to numeric codes by scripts/import-jmsml.mjs and tabulated by
scripts/generate-names.mjs; the changed form is src/legacy-2525c.generated.ts.
